    {
      "name": "Bookings",
      "description": "Phase 2 — Booking system & rental lifecycle.\n\nState machine: pending → held → confirmed → picked_up → in_use → return_pending → returned → inspected → completed (plus cancelled / late / disputed). All transitions are audited into BookingStatusHistory. Active statuses (held/confirmed/picked_up/in_use/return_pending/returned/inspected) block the equipment's date range via a `booked` AvailabilityBlock.\n\nHappy path: POST /bookings → held → POST /bookings/:id/payments → confirmed → POST /bookings/:id/pickup → picked_up → POST /bookings/:id/return {action:initiate} → return_pending → POST /bookings/:id/return {action:confirm} → returned → POST /bookings/:id/inspect → inspected → POST /bookings/:id/complete → completed.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Check availability (public)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/bookings/check-availability", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "bookings", "check-availability"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"equipmentId\": \"{{equipment_id}}\",\n  \"startDate\": \"2026-02-10T09:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"endDate\": \"2026-02-13T09:00:00.000Z\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create booking (customer)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/bookings", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "bookings"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"equipmentId\": \"{{equipment_id}}\",\n  \"startDate\": \"2026-02-10T09:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"endDate\": \"2026-02-13T09:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"idempotencyKey\": \"checkout-1740000000\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List my bookings",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/bookings?status=&page=1&limit=12", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "bookings"], "query": [
              { "key": "status", "value": "" },
              { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
              { "key": "limit", "value": "12" }
